    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_617eb21f813f46311943c27f6ff044a8330aff6f4cadc8cbd150229ace1c9b72",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The paper's conjectures form a typed dependency graph rather than one interchangeable package: pointwise Conjecture 2 implies mean-square Conjecture 1; Conjectures 1 and 3 have separately argued consequences for E₂ and the eighth moment; and only narrower reformulations receive equivalence proofs, including Conjecture 2's vertical-decay form, the eighth moment's weaker piecewise Z₂ estimate, and the all-k transform hierarchy's relation to Lindelöf.",
